# Biome Seven - an island of the library's plan The Sunken Kingdom (sunken 18 m; chapter 4, the glass dome)
# The last of the Network's seabed gardens: a glass rotunda on the seabed (twelve of Balboa's relay-station window
# walls in a ring, a second ring leaning in over them, a steel cap) with dry air inside - a garden of crop beds, a mango
# tree, pineapple and berries, the gardener's rota, the control desk, the seed vault and a lab goat in a cage. The
# airlock is a short block tunnel on the north side with a hatch in its roof. Outside: a big puffer, stingrays at the
# outer vent and its shed, three reefs, glowing water, and the marker buoy on the surface. Quest "The Glass Dome"
# (17 steps): the airlock, its hatch, the rota, three melon seed packets, the engine control plans, 2 stingrays, the
# metal detector plans, the firework plans, the sprinkler crank (the dry beds give way to full ones), the zipline plans
# on the maintenance gantry on the dome's cap.
#
# Points (metres over the island's own water line; in the world it all lies 18 m lower): the seabed at 0 (r 16 round
# 0 0); the dome r 6.7 round 0 0, its glass 0..6.7, the cap at 6.7 (x -4.5..4.5, z -4.5..4.5); the airlock x -1.5..1.5,
# z 6.7..9.7, its roof at 2.9 (the hatch at 0.75 8.95); the vent shed x -2.25..2.25, z -14..-11; the buoy at 11 -11
# on the surface (18 m up), an air pocket at its foot.
include lib_sea
include lib_gravity
include lib_sl1
include lib_sunken
include lib_features
# RESIZE 10-24: Radius 32 -> 85, the seabed hills higher. The dome, its airlock, the vent shed and the buoy stay together
# in the middle (the dive from the buoy to the airlock is one breath); the outer reefs move out x2.66 with the land.
new
gen Trees=0 Bushes=0 Rocks=0.35 Harvest=0 BeachThings=0
gen Seed=10401 Radius=85 Height=12 Roughness=0.3 Peaks=3 Shape=0 Style=0 BeachWidth=0.1 Cliffs=0.3 PeakShape=0.4
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.4 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.3 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0.35
generate
elevation -18

