note diverslate Diver's slate | DIVE SLATE - I. MARLOWE (chalk, wired to a box)\n\nDOMES 1-6 DARK. SEVEN STILL LIT.\nAir at the buoy, air at the vent shed. Don't stay down past the second breath.\n\nMilo - the lab lady says you all walked off the reef. All twelve. I sat on the lab stairs and cried like a tap, and then I swam here, because the gardener has a boat.\nTeo caught up at last, with a hen in his coat. He says the hen insisted.
note divercache Diver's cache | A diver's spare kit: rope, a spare filter, glass for a mask.
loot divercache Rope*2;Glass*3;Plastic*4
prop divercache loot.refill=0
