loot b7locker Seed_Flower_Red*2;Seed_Flower_Blue*2;MetalIngot*2;Rope*3
prop b7locker loot.refill=0
note b7sumnote Gardener's marker | THE GARDEN ROCK\n\nWe planted the dome's first seeds on this rock, above the water, the day the dome opened: Sato, me and a very small brass band.\nFrom here you can see the shelf the domes sat on, one to seven, like beads. Six of them are dark now.\nOn a clear night you can see the Spirecrest beacon blink from here, and the Spire itself behind it, every window bright. The only bright windows on the sea. Funny, that, for a man who orders everybody else's lights off.
note b7bldnote Seed keeper's list | SEED STORE - STOCK (W. Ashby)\n\nStrawberry, watermelon, the red and blue flowers, and the beet nobody likes.\nThe store flooded the same night as the lab - pumps to REMOTE, the board says, at 02:14. Same minute. Same hand.\nI swam the stock out twice and gave up the third time, when I saw the light come down the ramp after me.\nWhat is left is in the chest on the ground floor, with the old crest shard we dug up when we laid the foundations. Air on the first floor. Take what grows.
note b7ledge Diver's shelf cache | A diver's cache on the rock's shelf, out of the current.
loot b7ledge Rope*3;Bolt*2;Feather*3
prop b7ledge loot.refill=0
note b7cave2chest Grower's spare chest | A grower's chest deep in the rock cave.
loot b7cave2chest CopperOre*3;Rope*2;Battery*1
prop b7cave2chest loot.refill=0
prop b7summit zone.id=b7_summit
prop b7summit zone.radius=2.5
prop b7summit zone.message=Out of the water: the garden rock, a beacon on top. Biome Seven glints below.

quest title=The Glass Dome
quest intro=Dr Sato's drive woke the last dome's beacon. Dive to the airlock and find the gardener.
step reach|airlock|1|Dive to the airlock hatch on the big glass dome
step collect|story:cycled|1|Open the airlock hatch
step read|Gardener's rota|1|Read the gardener's rota
step collect|story:melonseed|3|Take the three melon seed packets from the beds
step blueprint|Blueprint_EngineControls|1|Find the engine control plans at the control desk
step read|Hydrophone log|1|Read the hydrophone printout by the control desk
step kill|Stingray|2|Drive the stingrays off the outer vent
step blueprint|Blueprint_MetalDetector|1|Take the metal detector plans from the vent shed
step read|Gardener's shed book|1|Read the book in the gardener's shed outside the dome
step read|Car park ticket|1|Read the ticket at the sunken car park
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineBase|1|Swim up to the gantry on the dome's cap: zipline plans
step open|Seed store chest|1|Dive into the drowned seed store in the pit and open its chest
step blueprint|Blueprint_Firework|1|Back in the dome, open the gardener's locker: firework plans
step collect|story:watered|1|Turn the sprinkler crank to water the beds
step read|Wren's letter|1|Read the letter that came up out of the dry bed
quest done=The garden breathes again. Wren took Ines and Teo up to the Thalassa surface station - the Receiver finds it on band 900.
quest reward=Seed_Watermelon*3;Seed_Mango*1

save Biome Seven
